gh and i'll be following this up  with a season two questions video  sometime during this week so let me know  what questions you have for that in the  comments and let me know what you  thought of the season what you thought  of the finale and if you want to talk  book spoilers just make sure you mark  them please like this video if you  enjoyed it please subscribe to my  channel if you haven't already and  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon

